1
00:00:00,050 --> 00:00:07,708
Paál placed a cut tip off-centre, in darkness, and got bending anyway: the chemical, not the light, makes the curve.

2
00:00:07,708 --> 00:00:13,828
Finally Went, in nineteen twenty-eight, soaked the chemical out of tips into agar blocks.

3
00:00:13,828 --> 00:00:20,156
A block on one side of a decapitated oat coleoptile made it bend away from that side.

4
00:00:20,156 --> 00:00:22,044
He named the substance auxin.

